[0.000, "o", "\u001b[H                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n               \u001b[35mShamanic Mountain Guardian - Shamogu v1.6.0\u001b[39m                      \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n┌───────────────\u001b[33mNew Game\u001b[39m───────────────┐┌──────────Four-Headed Hydra───────────┐\u001b[K\r\n│\u001b[36mPrimary Spirit Selection              \u001b[39m││\u001b[36mAbility\u001b[37m (focus 2/2 charges)\u001b[36m:\u001b[34m Focus\u001b[39m    │\u001b[K\r\n│\u001b[33m\u001b[40mH - Four-Headed Hydra                 \u001b[39m\u001b[49m││for 3 turns. Attack frontally with    │\u001b[K\r\n│B - Rampaging Boar                    ││all four heads.\u001b[32m Instant\u001b[39m.              │\u001b[K\r\n│\u001b[40mF - Jumping Frog                      \u001b[49m││\u001b[36mTraits:\u001b[39m four-directional attack,      │\u001b[K\r\n│f - Wind Fox                          ││attack bonus per extra foe.           │\u001b[K\r\n│\u001b[40mc - Temporal Cat                      \u001b[49m│└──────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[K\r\n│C - Spinning Crocodile \u001b[37m(advanced)\u001b[39m     │                                        \u001b[K\r\n│\u001b[40mb - Vampiric Bat \u001b[37m(advanced)\u001b[39m           \u001b[49m│                                        \u001b[K\r\n└──────────────────────────────────────┘                                        \u001b[K\u001b[32m\r\n(TAB for mod selection)\u001b[39m                                                         \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n    All life in your mountain is being corrupted. Beasts are losing their       \u001b[K\r\n    minds and becoming aggressive. These disturbing events started to happen    \u001b[K\r\n    after a dungeon portal suddenly appeared at the top of the mountain. As     \u001b[K\r\n    the guardian, you decide to explore that dungeon in order to find and       \u001b[K\r\n    destroy the source of corruption… You hope luck will be on your side!       \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n                                                                                \u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[24;81H"]
